    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a significant move to strengthen preparedness for rising temperatures, the Centre of Excellence for Trauma and Emergencies (CETE) at Aga Khan University (AKU), in collaboration with the Provincial Disaster Management Authority (PDMA) Sindh, hosted a City Heat Action Plan Consultative Meeting on Friday, June 20, 2025.",
